{"src":"en","tgt":"ro","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":164500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ro","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":6144.752599,"text":"But after losing the captain's wicket, India only made 36 runs, losing seven was a big"},{"kind":"text","t":6543.865831,"text":"Dar după ce a pierdut wicket-ul căpitanului, India a făcut doar 36 de puncte, pierzând șapte a fost o mare pierdere."},{"kind":"audio","t":6563.029312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6567.038386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6570.841892,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6575.906161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6579.59197,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6584.238904000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6585.800262,"samples":20195,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":12767.580061,"text":"They usually have special food, drink, and entertainment offers to keep guests in a good mood and to keep them at the premise."},{"kind":"text","t":13226.128609,"text":"De obicei, au oferte speciale de mâncare, băutură și divertisment pentru a menține oaspeții într-o dispoziție bună și pentru a le menține la premisă."},{"kind":"audio","t":13250.459567000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":13254.725106999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13258.967357000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13263.471484000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13268.387185,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13272.949921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":13277.711354,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13279.333041000002,"samples":20129,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":19256.613343,"text":"Del Potro has the early advantage in the second set, but this is too required a tie break after"},{"kind":"text","t":19516.64306,"text":"Del Potro are avantajul timpuriu în al doilea set, dar acest lucru este prea necesar un tie break după"},{"kind":"audio","t":19539.221213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19540.514114999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19541.613739,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19543.009099,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19544.293721,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":19545.338827,"samples":6126,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":25310.756715,"text":"The internet combines elements of both mass and interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"text","t":25495.059626,"text":"Internetul combină elemente de comunicare în masă și interpersonală."},{"kind":"audio","t":25516.175839,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25520.455148999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25525.246552,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25525.659145999998,"samples":13345,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":34465.898720000005,"text":"The composition of these crystals matches those found in urine of affected pets when compared by infrared spectroscopy."},{"kind":"text","t":34871.908915,"text":"Compoziția acestor cristale se potrivește cu cele găsite în urina animalelor de companie afectate atunci când sunt comparate prin spectroscopie în infraroșu."},{"kind":"audio","t":34899.696815,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34903.909566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":34908.694319,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34913.652159000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34917.674162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34922.002482,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34926.155093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34930.201196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":34930.460103000005,"samples":427,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":36886.809967,"text":"F-T-I-R."},{"kind":"text","t":37009.610852000005,"text":"F-T-I-R."},{"kind":"audio","t":37023.616485000006,"samples":26254,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":42299.991884,"text":"on some routes the larger companies have their own planes but for other routes and smaller firms there was a"},{"kind":"text","t":42578.168886,"text":"Pe unele rute, companiile mai mari au propriile avioane, dar pentru alte rute și firme mai mici a existat o"},{"kind":"audio","t":42596.456299000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42601.155373,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42605.393273,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42610.27127500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42614.996948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42615.271735,"samples":9349,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":49520.700807,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means that they tend to break up"},{"kind":"text","t":49808.798669,"text":"Unii atomi au nuclee instabile, ceea ce înseamnă că au tendința de a se rupe"},{"kind":"audio","t":49829.855633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49833.697639000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49838.516301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49840.817679,"samples":24009,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":53503.107925000004,"text":"and break apart with little or no nudging."},{"kind":"text","t":53677.353997000006,"text":"şi se despart cu puţină sau nici o împingere."},{"kind":"audio","t":53695.418134,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53699.504716,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53700.463693000005,"samples":15552,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":60653.528285,"text":"The same month saw another airliner overrun a runway at Moshland and strike a wall killing 17."},{"kind":"text","t":61040.842183,"text":"În aceeași lună, un alt avion de linie a depășit o pistă la Moshland și a lovit un perete, omorând 17 persoane."},{"kind":"audio","t":61061.026860000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61062.142694,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61063.410306000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61064.912845000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61066.01971,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61067.528429000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":61067.690016,"samples":7689,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":67227.340716,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":67552.171272,"text":"Acestea sunt aproape toate plaje de nisip cu înot în condiții de siguranță și cele mai multe au umbra oferite de copaci."},{"kind":"audio","t":67576.402642,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":67580.365686,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67585.04169,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67590.0621,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67595.078269,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67597.348797,"samples":26918,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":70279.207979,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":70352.48254900001,"text":"Copaci Pohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":70367.079904,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":70367.37983,"samples":3531,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":76434.898404,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby."},{"kind":"text","t":76767.236315,"text":"Sporturile populare includ fotbal, baschet, volei, polo pe apă, scrimă, rugby."},{"kind":"audio","t":76789.373714,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76793.271999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76796.503104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":76800.140253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":76801.828049,"samples":22461,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":80708.078328,"text":"cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and F1."},{"kind":"text","t":80910.941598,"text":"Ciclism, hochei pe gheaţă, hochei pe role şi F1."},{"kind":"audio","t":80928.999564,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":80932.82293000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":80937.040661,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":80937.248198,"samples":2306,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":86527.32564000001,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":86731.045558,"text":"În climatul cald al Orientului Mijlociu, casa nu era atât de importantă."},{"kind":"audio","t":86752.054963,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86756.466361,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":86760.933708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86762.94595000001,"samples":25019,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":93212.896101,"text":"Lake Olai lies 120 kilometers north of Peninsula. The largest"},{"kind":"text","t":93398.608702,"text":"Lacul Olai se află la 120 de kilometri nord de Peninsula."},{"kind":"audio","t":93418.533012,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93423.061488,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93427.732692,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93428.116847,"samples":12555,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":98332.420254,"text":"The cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic, basic, alkaline the chemical is."},{"kind":"text","t":98665.435815,"text":"Sucul de varză își schimbă culoarea în funcție de cât de acidă, bazică, alcalină este substanța chimică."},{"kind":"audio","t":98689.167682,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98693.675128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98698.051857,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98701.491769,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98706.39639000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98707.81922,"samples":20320,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":105757.69191200001,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to be fully operational in September 2017 when the Brazilian custom checkpoints are expected to be finished."},{"kind":"text","t":106154.338579,"text":"Podul este programat să fie pe deplin operațional în septembrie 2017, când se așteaptă ca punctele de control vamal braziliene să fie finalizate."},{"kind":"audio","t":106181.811803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106186.060044,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106190.759058,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106195.492631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106199.585624,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106203.562448,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106208.678746,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106213.71948500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":106214.11319,"samples":12278,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":113153.04591100001,"text":"The moisture on your hands will react with the outer layers, which will feel funny and form a sort of shell."},{"kind":"text","t":113493.946841,"text":"Umezeala de pe mâini va reacționa cu straturile exterioare, care se vor simți amuzante și vor forma un fel de coajă."},{"kind":"audio","t":113519.252656,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113523.408007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113527.368302,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113532.751346,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113537.958733,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113540.156262,"samples":25799,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":119604.750237,"text":"One bomb exploded outside the Governor's General's office."},{"kind":"text","t":119774.088128,"text":"O bombă a explodat în fața biroului guvernatorului general."},{"kind":"audio","t":119794.047678,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119799.06594700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119803.25475800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":119803.532444,"samples":3787,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":125315.493594,"text":"The Moroccan Sultan rebuilt the city as Daru i Bayt"},{"kind":"text","t":125503.37077400001,"text":"Sultanul marocan a reconstruit orașul ca Daru i Bayt"},{"kind":"audio","t":125523.154486,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125527.474696,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125531.12403400001,"samples":29217,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"input","t":130432.75882900001,"text":"and it was given the name Casablanca by Spanish traders who established trading bases."},{"kind":"text","t":130709.35159300001,"text":"Numele Casablanca i-a fost dat de către comercianții spanioli care au înființat aici baze comerciale."},{"kind":"audio","t":130731.13440699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130735.09144100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130739.671567,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130744.677136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130748.43716400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":130748.70315,"samples":843,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":142855.583884,"text":"He was greeted by Singapore's Deputy Prime Minister Wong Kan-seng and discussed trade and terrorism issues with the Singapore Prime Minister Lee Hsien Long."},{"kind":"text","t":143244.044696,"text":"El a fost întâmpinat de vicepremierul Wong Kan-seng și a discutat despre comerț și terorism cu prim-ministrul Lee Hsien Long."},{"kind":"audio","t":143268.94191599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143273.83243799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143278.316704,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143282.534005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143287.570454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143292.72840199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143293.10893699998,"samples":13680,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":154269.23860699998,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":154603.361893,"text":"Bomba de fisiune funcționează pe principiul că este nevoie de energie pentru a pune împreună un nucleu cu mulți protoni și neutroni."},{"kind":"audio","t":154627.930328,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":154631.86085199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154636.795483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154641.116422,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154645.91959499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154650.47756099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154651.161481,"samples":15629,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":162827.94977099999,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":163038.337625,"text":"În arhipelag și pe lacuri nu aveți neapărat nevoie de un iaht"},{"kind":"audio","t":163058.527202,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163062.746222,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":163067.2069,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":163067.441936,"samples":2232,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":174504.881695,"code":1005}]}